    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43875" root="&#xA;                        نخع&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُخَاعٌ</span></b> 
                         The <i>spinal cord,</i> or <i>spinal marrow;</i>
(S, K, &amp;c.;) <i>what extends from the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَامَة</span>
                        <i>through</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى</span>) <i>the vertebræ to the end of the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَنَب</span>, <i>like a
cord of marrow.</i> (Zj in his “ Khalk el-Insán. ”)
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَلِيلٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">البِخَاعُ</span>.

